```

## The study's structure

`CastorEDC.Kino.study/2` shows the study's visits, forms and fields, then its repeating data and surveys.

```elixir
CastorEDC.Kino.study(client, study_id)
```

## Participants

Pages render as tables, and records as trees.

```elixir
participants = CastorEDC.Participants.list_participants!(client, study_id)
```

```elixir
List.first(participants.entries)
```

## Collected data

This cell loads the study's values, as rows.
It fetches every value the study has collected, which takes a while on a large study.

