## Errors

Livebook shows a result tuple as it is, so `{:ok, page}` and `{:error, error}` print as plain terms.
The views appear for the value inside, so the `!` functions, which return it or raise, show them directly.
Match an error out to see its view: the message, status, code and details the API sent.

```elixir
{:error, error} = CastorEDC.Participants.get_participant(client, study_id, "999999")
error
```

